{"unit_id":"Shinarin__dsh-remielle-pet#card-zh","repo":"Shinarin/dsh-remielle-pet","commit":"daa0c8d1df4fb3decc75c6a6c1eae6e5299f92cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remielle-pet 是一款适用于 DSH Web UI 和桌面版的蕾米埃尔桌宠插件。它通过客户端浮层跟随会话状态切换 GIF，并在设置页提供桌宠配置。宠物可拖动并记住相对窗口右下角的位置，支持点击互动、审批提醒、调整大小和为不同状态上传自定义 GIF；状态包括空闲、思考、回答和待审批。适合希望在 DSH 界面获得可视会话状态提示和个性化桌宠的用户。无需额外账号或 API 密钥，设置和自定义 GIF 保存在本地浏览器及 DSH 配置文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:58-76","client.js:272-313","client.js:579-624","client.js:788-899","lib/index.js:136-199"]}
{"unit_id":"Shinarin__dsh-remielle-pet#card-en","repo":"Shinarin/dsh-remielle-pet","commit":"daa0c8d1df4fb3decc75c6a6c1eae6e5299f92cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remielle-pet is a desk pet for DSH Web UI and desktop. It switches GIFs for idle, thinking, answering, and approval states. Users can drag it, interact by clicking, set approval alerts, resize it, and upload custom GIFs. No account or API key is needed; settings are stored locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:58-76","client.js:272-313","client.js:579-624","client.js:788-899","lib/index.js:136-199"]}
