{"unit_id":"Shinarin__dsh-remielle-pet#feature-1","repo":"Shinarin/dsh-remielle-pet","commit":"daa0c8d1df4fb3decc75c6a6c1a6e5299f92cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remielle-pet 的功能「会话状态动画」：桌宠根据 DSH 会话状态切换空闲、思考、回答和待审批 GIF。状态检测结合 DOM 变化观察与定时轮询，并按待审批、内容生成、会话运行的优先级判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:177-186","client.js:272-313"]}
